# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Whiteboard Studio — environment variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The app works with ZERO configuration: boards are stored locally
# in the browser (IndexedDB, with a localStorage fallback).
#
# The variables below are optional and only needed if you add a
# backend for cross-device sync / real-time collaboration.
# Never commit real secrets — copy this file to `.env.local`.

# Optional: Postgres (Neon / Supabase / Vercel Postgres) connection string
# used by the (not yet implemented) cloud sync API routes.
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host/db?sslmode=require"

# Optional: an auth provider secret if you add user accounts.
# AUTH_SECRET="generate-with-openssl-rand-base64-32"

# Optional: realtime provider (Liveblocks / Partykit / Supabase Realtime) key.
# REALTIME_PUBLIC_KEY=""

# Optional: public base URL, used when composing share links server-side.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="https://your-app.vercel.app"
